acceptance_criteria: "Same event set and declared policy yields deterministic current/as-of results, including late and out-of-order observations; Conflicting assertions are surfaced with both evidence paths; no silent last-writer-wins truth; Superseding a decision preserves its historical validity and invalidates exactly the affected downstream dependencies; Verification of evidence revision A cannot validate changed revision B; expiration requires refresh or explicit abstention; Historical reads preserve recorded-time versus valid-time distinctions and report unknown/ambiguous intervals; Tests cover correction, retraction, overlap, missing evidence, deleted source, cycle, duplicate delivery, concurrent append and clock-skew inputs; Property tests verify replay determinism and invalidation convergence; packed SDK consumer and CLI/MCP parity prove the public boundary; Bounded results expose omitted work and continuation; small-workspace cost and current quality gates do not regress"
